  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n\u0131n ilk k\u0131s\u0131mlar\u0131nda b\xF6l\xFCk p\xF6r\xE7\xFCk
    imgeler g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Kimisi par\xE7alanm\u0131\u015F, kimiyse adeta delik
    de\u015Fik olmu\u015F. Anla\u015F\u0131lan o ki son g\xF6r\xFC\u015Fmelerinizde
    s\xF6yledi\u011Fi s\xF6zlerle ayr\u0131 oldu\u011Fun e\u015Finin dilindeki kur\u015Fun,
    ara s\u0131ra yad edece\u011Fin hat\u0131ralar\u0131 bile yaralam\u0131\u015F.
    Telvelerin, nasibin \xF6n\xFCne her ne yap\u0131l\u0131rsa yap\u0131ls\u0131n
    ge\xE7ilemeyece\u011Fini s\xF6yl\xFCyor {{isim}}. Sen de elinden geleni yapm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    Lakin ayn\u0131 nasip, bazen mucizeler de do\u011Furur. Ne yalan s\xF6yleyeyim,
    ben yine de ince bir umut seziyorum..."
